1 REM FBCS SEG-0503
2 REM CLAIM A-12.1.4-TR128
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM STD 12.1.4 l.8805-8807, 9.2.4.2 l.4718-4723: the detached-handler of an EXTERNAL PICTURE sees its parameters.
100 DECLARE EXTERNAL PICTURE P
110 DRAW P(5)
120 END
200 EXTERNAL PICTURE P(N)
210   WHEN EXCEPTION USE H
220     CAUSE EXCEPTION 5
230   END WHEN
240   HANDLER H
250     PRINT N
260   END HANDLER
270 END PICTURE
